{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 14, "text": "关于工作组（一九六六年八月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n211)\n关于工作组\n（一九六六年八月）\n全国的工作组几乎百分之九十以上犯了普遍性的方向和路线错误。\n（摘自周总理八月二十二日讲话）\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-0563858c984821b5e2cd", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-211.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "0f693b600ab93a1e628dec18ffacefd37876b2aad2a98c12a91795bdd841f56b", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "3a51f0461548231b7a54bc564fcdeec1631374453e30a522078b42dc76b0f4c1", "text_chars": 130}
